              <button type="button" class="quick-index-tab" data-quick-index-source="ipfs" role="tab" aria-selected="false">◇ IPFS</button>
            </div>

            <div class="quick-index-pane" data-quick-index-pane="file">
              <input id="quickIndexFile" type="file" hidden>
              <div id="quickIndexDrop" class="quick-index-drop" role="button" tabindex="0" aria-controls="quickIndexFile">
                <span class="quick-index-drop-icon" aria-hidden="true">↥</span>
                <span class="quick-index-drop-copy"><strong id="quickIndexFileName">Drop a text or structured-text file here, or click to browse</strong><span>Markdown · Org · JSON · JSONL · CSV/TSV · HTML/XML · YAML · source code · plain text</span></span>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="quick-index-pane" data-quick-index-pane="url" hidden>
              <div class="quick-index-field"><label for="quickIndexUrl">Public HTTP(S) URL</label><input id="quickIndexUrl" type="url" inputmode="url" autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false" placeholder="https://example.org/knowledge.jsonl"><small>Fetched server-side with private-network and redirect protection.</small></div>
            </div>

            <div class="quick-index-pane" data-quick-index-pane="ipfs" hidden>
              <div class="quick-index-field"><label for="quickIndexCid">IPFS CID</label><input id="quickIndexCid" type="text" autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false" placeholder="bafy… or Qm…"><small>You may paste a bare CID, ipfs://CID, or /ipfs/CID.</small></div>
            </div>

            <div class="quick-index-actions">
              <button type="button" class="button button-outline" id="quickIndexInspect">Detect structure</button>
              <button type="button" class="button button-primary" id="quickIndexQueue" disabled>Index detected source ↗</button>
              <span class="quick-index-status" id="quickIndexStatus" role="status" aria-live="polite">Ready</span>
            </div>

            <div class="quick-index-analysis" id="quickIndexAnalysis" aria-live="polite"><p class="quick-index-empty">Choose a source, then detect its structure before indexing.</p></div>
            <div class="quick-index-public-note"><span aria-hidden="true">ⓘ</span><span><strong>Searchable/public pipeline:</strong> file and URL bytes are content-addressed in this node's IPFS store before the existing <code>ipfs_cid → searchable_disk</code> job runs. Use Knowledge &amp; privacy instead for confidential corpora.</span></div>
          </section>
